        "original_id": "1a89071d-d918-5571-bab0-2a521af0b55a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Edward L. Cahn, Khady Sylla, Tom Reed\n- Works: Afraid to Talk\n- Topics: film, literature\n\nFacts:\n- Edward L. Cahn was born on February 12, 1899, and he was an American film director.\n- Afraid to Talk is a 1932 American Pre-Code drama film.\n- Afraid to Talk was directed by Edward L. Cahn and written by Tom Reed.\n- Khady Sylla was born in Dakar on March 27, 1963, and she was a Senegalese writer and filmmaker.\n- Khady Sylla wrote two novels, short work, and film.\n- Edward L. Cahn died on August 25, 1963.\n- Khady Sylla died in Dakar on October 8, 2013.",
